direction: down
input: "One admitted execution plan\nQ stdout capture + inherited stderr/stdin\nB inherited stdio\nSame policy under Scheme / C / Zig"
controller: "Stable job owner + generation\nAcquired resources / child custody / observation state\nNo independent native reaper in Gambit process"
terminal: "Terminal axis\nLaunch failure or tool exit/signal\nOne designated status owner"
bytes: "Observation axis\nQ bounded BS1: used <= L; separate nonempty probe\nEOF / error / overflow kept distinct\nB requires no query buffer"
close: "Lifetime axis\nStreams/handles closing is not callback quiescence\nKeep control and byte storage until no future access\nScope cleanup alone cannot release an escaped owner"
join: "Result eligibility + resource retirement\nCorrect terminal state and complete admitted observation\nNo partial flags / premature free / worker-exit-as-tool-success\nUnknown or pending custody remains explicit"
delivery: "Decode / result construction / delivery axis\nFallible work keeps backing owners guarded\nAccepted transfer or acknowledged release\nScheme exceptions / continuation need controller policy"
gate: "FT01-FT10 qualification remains open\nNo tree-cancellation or bounded-cleanup promise\nByte bound is not a time bound\nDesign only: no implementation or native test" {
  style.fill: "#fff0ce"
}
input -> controller
controller -> terminal
controller -> bytes
controller -> close
terminal -> join
bytes -> join
close -> join
join -> delivery
delivery -> gate
